ions built around Swiss Ephemeris data, including natal charts and synastry. The extremely keyword-stuffed namespace and promotional performance language are clear spam-like signals; any astronomical calculations and privacy claims should be independently checked.</p></article><article class="min-w-0 rounded-card border border-border bg-paper-raised/40 px-5 py-4"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><h3 class="min-w-0 font-display text-base font-semibold leading-snug"><a href="/servers/io-github-finddatatechnology-eco-mcp-fetch" class="break-words text-ink no-underline hover:text-dead">eco-mcp-fetch</a> <span class="meta-mono ml-1 break-all !normal-case">io.github.FindDataTechnology/eco-mcp-fetch</span></h3><span class="stamp stamp-dead " style="transform:rotate(0.5deg)">Flagged</span></div><p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Presents itself as an ecosystem-hosted version of the Model Context Protocol fetch reference implementation. The description combines an attribution claim with unrelated promotional text, a clear spam signal, while providing no package or maintenance evidence for this remote-only deployment.</p></article><article class="min-w-0 rounded-card border border-border bg-paper-raised/40 px-5 py-4"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-x-4 gap-y-2"><h3 class="min-w-0 font-display text-base font-semibold leading-snug"><a href="/servers/io-github-finddatatechnology-airegistry-tools" class="break-words text-ink no-underline hover:text-dead">AI Registry tools</a> <span class="meta-mono ml-1 break-all !normal-case">io.github.FindDataTechnology/airegistry-tools</span></h3><span class="stamp stamp-dead " style="transform:rotate(-1deg)">Flagged</span></div><p class="mt-2.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted [overflow-wrap:anywhere]">Claims to provide discovery and listing tools for servers, agents, and skills in an AI registry. The appended u